WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:02,930
What about kidnapping Captain Li?

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,250
I don't know what you are talking about

3
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:07,100
How many daughters does your father have? I am the only one

4
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:11,340
That's right, that can't be wrong

5
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,220
You don't know about your kidnapping

6
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,860
I don't know what Captain Li is talking about and

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:20,460
Does this matter have anything to do with whether you let people go or not? Does it have a lot to do with what you just said?

8
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:21,780
Chen Yundong is your assistant

9
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:32,660
Is it an employee of your company who is responsible for what happened in three days? It was only three days when Chen Yundong came to our company. I did the math, that is to say.

10
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:40,670
Did he go to work in your company on the third day after you were kidnapped? How did he go to apply for the job? You go out first. I have something to say.

11
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:43,710
It's not okay to chat with Miss Zhang alone, but Captain Li

12
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:45,710
I hope you let him go as soon as possible after we talk.

13
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:51,470
You really don’t remember anything about what Captain Li wants to talk about.

14
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:52,390
About the last kidnapping

15
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:54,030
I don’t know this Chen Yundong either.

16
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:57,370
Captain Li asked what this means about our relationship with you.

17
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:00,870
What happened that night five days ago?

18
00:01:00,870 --> 00:01:02,110
You won't have any impression at all

19
00:01:02,890 --> 00:01:03,850
five days ago

20
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,400
That night I was robbed and knocked unconscious

21
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:09,960
Why are you robbing me by asking this all of a sudden?

22
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:13,320
Who told you it was a robbery? What happened to my dad?

23
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:19,720
Isn't it a robbery? It seems that your father is hiding something from you. Let me tell you that night.

24
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:21,600
It's not a robbery but a kidnapping

25
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,400
And Chen Yundong is very suspicious

26
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:28,280
He's one of the kidnappers, so I have to remind you to stay away from him.

27
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:29,800
He approaches you deliberately

28
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:32,720
There must be some plot against you, some kind of kidnapping

29
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:35,280
Chen Yundong is the kidnapper Captain Li

30
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:38,440
Do you have any evidence for saying that? I am a law enforcement member.

31
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:41,860
There's no way I'd be suspicious of someone that night

32
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:43,540
You were indeed kidnapped

33
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:45,820
Have you ever thought about a question

34
00:01:46,850 --> 00:01:47,850
Chen Yundong, why?

35
00:01:47,850 --> 00:01:49,090
Appeared there by such a coincidence

36
00:01:50,140 --> 00:01:52,780
Why was Chen Yundong able to knock down seven or eight people with his bare hands?

37
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,100
Desperado with weapons in hand

38
00:01:54,930 --> 00:02:00,210
And why is Chen Yundong so bold and harmless?

39
00:02:00,210 --> 00:02:06,370
When the law enforcement team arrives, they will drive you away with your life in a car. Originally, all this was according to the explanation he gave.

40
00:02:06,370 --> 00:02:07,450
It can also roughly explain the past

41
00:02:07,930 --> 00:02:11,560
But plus today’s point: your company, your assistant

42
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,760
Why did he appear in your company by chance?

43
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,840
And he also became your assistant
